@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
title UC01 新增商品 序列图
actor 操作员 as U
boundary "商品表单/HTTP API" as B
control "CatalogService" as C
database "H2" as DB
U -> B : 校验Product请求
B -> C : 调用用例操作
C -> DB : 创建商品及全部零库存行
DB --> C : 结果
C --> B : 返回商品ID
B --> U : 显示结果或错误
@enduml
